  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project-- Unite All Schools-- will provide meaningful opportunities for teachers and their students to develop as global citizen leaders by engaging them in real life projects with their peers from diverse countries across the world through innovative virtual exchange programs.  Students and teachers will develop the 21st century problem-solving, collaboration, and leadership skills to solve local and global challenges in partnership across communities and the world.</narrative>
  </description>
